'''Type of Feat''': [[Class]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[Archmage]] levels 1, 2, 3, 4, 5

'''Specifics''': Upon gaining a new level in [[Archmage]], the character gets to select a High Arcana feat from the following list:

*[[Arcane fire|Arcane Fire]]
*[[Mastery of elements|Mastery of Elements]]
*[[Mastery of shapes|Mastery of Shapes]]
*[[Spell-like ability (archmage)|Spell-Like ability]]
*[[Spell power|Spell Power]]


==Notes==
*Added in the [[PRC Expansion Pack]].

